  "releaseNotes": "1.0.10: PlayfieldDynels no longer drops trailing arguments on teleport functions. LineTeleport (53059) Arg1 now has 4 values (was 3), TeleportProxy (53082) has 6 (was 4), and TeleportProxy2 (53083) has 7 (was 4). The added values are appended; the existing leading values are unchanged. Consumers that assumed exactly four TeleportProxy/TeleportProxy2 arguments (or three LineTeleport arguments) will now see the longer lists. All other functions parse identically.",
